# Arti's guard manager targets a 20-guard filtered sample. Keep at least that
# many non-authority relays so the private network exercises the production
# guard policy instead of relying on undersized-network behavior. MutualBackup
# starts its five clients and services in sequence, so no Chutney-managed client
# or onion service is needed.
ConfigureNodes(
    Node(tag="a", authority=1, relay=1).getN(4)
    + Node(tag="r", relay=1, exit=1).getN(20)
)
